":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m035-0309","start":309,"end":311,"surface":"之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m035-0354","start":354,"end":356,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m035-0357","start":357,"end":359,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p034","text":"初，貳師起敦煌西，以為人多，道上國不能食，乃分為數軍，從南北道。校尉王申生、故鴻臚壺充國等千餘人，別到郁成。郁成城守，不肯給食其軍。王申生去大軍二百里，（偵）［偩］而輕之，責郁成。郁成食不肯出，窺知申生軍日少，晨用三千人攻，戮殺申生等，軍破，數人脫亡，走貳師。貳師令搜粟都尉上官桀往攻破郁成。郁成王亡走康居，桀追至康居。康居聞漢已破宛，乃出郁成王予桀，桀令四騎士縛守詣大將軍。四人相謂曰：「郁成王漢國所毒，今生將去，卒失大事。」欲殺，莫敢先擊。上邽騎士趙弟最少，拔劍擊之，斬郁成王，齎頭。弟、桀等逐及大將軍。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"王申生","kind":"person","person_id":"0w0_eh2_loq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"壺充國","kind":"person","person_id":"8wd_fcv_stu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"王申生","kind":"person","person_id":"0w0_eh2_loq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"申生","kind":"person","person_id":"0w0_eh2_loq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"申生","kind":"person","person_id":"0w0_eh2_loq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m034-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","pe